OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot visitors upset by
OL,4,Aparking charge plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to introduce car parking
OL,7,Fcharges at several beauty spots in
OL,8,FWorcestershire have been met with
OL,9,F"dismay" from visitors.
OL,11,FOptions include introducing payment
OL,12,Fmachines at Worcester Woods Country
OL,13,FPark, the Wilden Top car park at
OL,14,FHartlebury Common and picnic sites at
OL,15,FBlackstone, Pershore Bridges and
OL,16,FEckington Wharf.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
