OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot visitors upset by
OL,4,Aparking charge plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans are part of a wider review of
OL,7,Fdiscretionary services as
OL,8,FWorcestershire County Council faces a
OL,9,F#98m funding shortfall. But, bringing
OL,10,Fin parking fees will put people of
OL,11,Fvisiting the beauty spots, regulars
OL,12,Fsay.
OL,14,FCharges could also be increased at
OL,15,Fsites where visitors already pay,
OL,16,Fincluding Waseley Hills Country Park.
OL,17,FThe council has been approached for
OL,18,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
